      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あぁ、なるほど。\nそういえばコカトリス娘はそういう生態だった。\n僕は、ほっと胸を撫でおろした……のだが。",
      "jp_sha256": "a5672d05457186f749437e9002f9c29db855bc58128791eecbb5240e9558feb8",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아아, 그렇구나.\n그러고 보니 코카트리스 소녀는 그런 생태였다.\n나는 안심하며 가슴을 쓸어내렸……지만.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 42,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b002-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "0cb395035e6f8f49720e206b7d829df4e77b55ca7787c810d81ff641ae8d8d6b:000002_8562228967815182967:g0:r41",
      "row_index_0based": 41,
      "serialized_row_index": 41,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "あぁ、なるほど。\nそういえばコカトリス娘はそういう生態だった。\n僕は、ほっと胸を撫でおろした……のだが。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
